.TH SHB-STOP 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.4.0-prod" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-stop \- Stop a guarded agent session
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb stop [session-id]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Cleanly terminates the agent process tree and cleans up temporary sandbox/proxy state. Crucially, stopping an agent session never weakens or alters the SecretHarbor security policy.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb stop\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb stop a81f\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://secretharbor.dev
